WEBVTT

00:00:08.070 --> 00:00:11.240
Mr. Masaru, where have you gone?

00:00:15.620 --> 00:00:16.740
How much did you see?

00:00:18.540 --> 00:00:22.170
I'm glad Shirogane was safe.

00:00:22.920 --> 00:00:26.500
But that puppet that saved Shirogane
in the well...

00:00:26.960 --> 00:00:30.050
was she able to have a soul in the end?

00:00:30.210 --> 00:00:31.470
None of your business.

00:00:32.930 --> 00:00:37.260
Maman... Angelina died
because of you, Sadayoshi!

00:00:38.060 --> 00:00:39.770
Show yourself already!

00:00:40.140 --> 00:00:41.640
No, I'm Masaru!

00:00:41.810 --> 00:00:42.980
Silence!

00:00:43.850 --> 00:00:44.810
Guri-pon.

00:00:45.100 --> 00:00:47.070
Get your hands off Master Sadayoshi!

00:00:48.230 --> 00:00:51.110
An automaton.
What could be more proof than that?

00:00:51.280 --> 00:00:53.530
Leave him to me, and go!

00:00:53.700 --> 00:00:54.700
Go where?

00:00:54.990 --> 00:00:58.620
Why are you asking me?
Just do what you want to do!

00:00:59.700 --> 00:01:03.000
What I want to do...? I know.

00:01:03.500 --> 00:01:04.540
Running away again?

00:01:04.710 --> 00:01:08.800
I'm not running away.
I'll be back to prove who I am!

00:01:10.800 --> 00:01:13.550
Let it bloom or let it wither

00:01:13.720 --> 00:01:16.590
The setting sun ignites the horizon

00:01:16.760 --> 00:01:21.180
And the gears turn

00:01:31.230 --> 00:01:34.150
When the horn blows, the flames dance

00:01:34.320 --> 00:01:37.030
The story waits for no-one

00:01:37.200 --> 00:01:39.910
Off they go, the gears are churning

00:01:40.080 --> 00:01:43.250
A red past chases after you

00:01:43.450 --> 00:01:45.500
The jester's smile

00:01:45.670 --> 00:01:48.380
What's behind the mask?

00:01:48.540 --> 00:01:51.210
You can't erase the scars

00:01:51.380 --> 00:01:54.090
No matter how they burn

00:01:54.260 --> 00:01:56.930
Let it bloom or let it wither

00:01:57.090 --> 00:02:00.050
The setting sun ignites the horizon

00:02:00.220 --> 00:02:05.730
Alone in the depths of the night

00:02:05.890 --> 00:02:09.810
Let out a cry that can cut through fate

00:02:09.980 --> 00:02:12.400
That's the cue to begin

00:02:12.570 --> 00:02:15.990
The curtain is rising, it's time to dance

00:02:16.360 --> 00:02:20.070
Everybody sheds tears at the end

00:02:20.240 --> 00:02:23.040
So hold them in now and keep going

00:02:23.200 --> 00:02:27.750
Until the day the curtain falls

00:02:27.920 --> 00:02:33.210
The gears will keep turning

00:02:41.050 --> 00:02:42.890
#19 The truth behind the shadow

00:02:43.060 --> 00:02:47.310
I just have to find Dean
to prove that I'm not him.

00:02:52.020 --> 00:02:53.110
Mr. Masaru!

00:02:53.270 --> 00:02:56.570
I finally found you!
I'm so glad you are safe.

00:02:56.740 --> 00:02:58.280
Why are you here?

00:02:58.530 --> 00:03:02.160
Forgive me, I couldn't help it
and had to look for you.

00:03:02.330 --> 00:03:04.740
The whole circus has come, too.

00:03:04.910 --> 00:03:05.950
Éléonore.

00:03:07.750 --> 00:03:09.040
Get away from Sadayoshi.

00:03:16.840 --> 00:03:18.380
Why did you do that?

00:03:18.550 --> 00:03:21.090
Why did you attack him?

00:03:21.260 --> 00:03:23.260
There's no time to explain.

00:03:25.220 --> 00:03:26.020
Mr. Masaru!

00:03:30.020 --> 00:03:32.480
-There he is!
-In the bushes!

00:03:38.110 --> 00:03:39.240
Éléonore.

00:03:42.490 --> 00:03:43.740
Éléonore!

00:03:47.290 --> 00:03:48.290
No...!

00:03:49.460 --> 00:03:53.330
She has drunk Aqua Vitae too?

00:03:54.170 --> 00:03:57.460
And she has the soft stone inside her.

00:03:58.340 --> 00:04:03.220
Don't make her walk the same path I did.

00:04:04.680 --> 00:04:06.470
This is a disaster!

00:04:07.180 --> 00:04:12.400
Not just automata, but shiroganes
will also be out looking for her.

00:04:14.360 --> 00:04:17.020
This girl, Éléonore, has died.

00:04:17.860 --> 00:04:22.780
And Angelina has disappeared
with the soft stone.

00:04:24.820 --> 00:04:26.490
You mean for us to lie?

00:04:27.120 --> 00:04:30.040
It's a very painful lie, but yes.

00:04:31.210 --> 00:04:37.250
There's no other way to save her
from her accursed destiny.

00:04:38.750 --> 00:04:40.720
20 YEARS LATER

00:04:41.920 --> 00:04:47.560
From that day on, this storehouse
in Kuroga Village was Éléonore's home.

00:04:50.930 --> 00:04:53.640
Did you have a nightmare again?

00:04:54.520 --> 00:04:55.520
Mr. Guy...

00:04:56.560 --> 00:04:59.690
What kind of dream was it? Tell me.

00:05:00.690 --> 00:05:04.490
I decided to never let her see me.

00:05:05.530 --> 00:05:11.000
She must grow up as an orphan.
It's better she doesn't know me.

00:05:12.620 --> 00:05:18.500
It's the same nightmare again.
Puppets attacking her, a man choking her.

00:05:19.000 --> 00:05:23.090
The Francine doll had melted
into the Aqua Vitae in the well.

00:05:23.380 --> 00:05:25.760
It must be the doll's memory.

00:05:26.180 --> 00:05:29.310
But what about the other recurring dream?

00:05:29.970 --> 00:05:34.730
About how a kind person came to her
when she was locked up in a small room?

00:05:35.140 --> 00:05:36.020
That's it.

00:05:36.190 --> 00:05:40.360
That doll had the real hair
of the human it was modeled after.

00:05:41.110 --> 00:05:43.740
It must be that person's memory, then.

00:05:45.780 --> 00:05:51.290
Either way, Éléonore's memory will be
eaten up by the other memories.

00:05:51.450 --> 00:05:56.290
She won't be able to tell the difference
between her memories and the others.

00:05:57.290 --> 00:05:59.090
Shoji.

00:06:00.170 --> 00:06:02.090
Won't you leave her to me?

00:06:03.170 --> 00:06:05.550
I'll travel the world with her
for a while.

00:06:07.220 --> 00:06:08.840
Once everything has calmed down,

00:06:09.010 --> 00:06:12.720
I'll take her to Quiberon
as a lost orphan.

00:06:14.430 --> 00:06:19.440
To make sure Éléonore can fight
whatever may disrupt her happiness,

00:06:19.610 --> 00:06:22.070
she should train as a shirogane.

00:06:23.900 --> 00:06:27.990
Once she's trained enough
to stand on her own,

00:06:28.160 --> 00:06:30.160
come to Quiberon and take her home.

00:06:33.370 --> 00:06:35.200
37 YEARS LATER, QUIBERON

00:06:35.370 --> 00:06:37.160
Years passed.

00:06:39.000 --> 00:06:42.170
I'm searching for the soft stone
that was lost in Japan.

00:06:42.840 --> 00:06:46.170
So please send
your youngest female shirogane.

00:06:47.130 --> 00:06:49.890
I have just the child for you.

00:06:50.390 --> 00:06:55.890
It's a girl that Guy Christophe found
while traveling in Scandinavia.

00:06:58.980 --> 00:07:01.400
I know that already.

00:07:03.440 --> 00:07:06.110
Because Guy and I made that lie up.

00:07:12.910 --> 00:07:14.200
Finally.

00:07:15.950 --> 00:07:17.370
We finally meet.

00:07:19.460 --> 00:07:20.880
My beloved daughter.

00:07:30.130 --> 00:07:33.760
No, this is our first time to meet.

00:07:36.430 --> 00:07:40.560
I must be businesslike.
Like a person asking her to do a mission.

00:07:41.270 --> 00:07:43.230
H-Hello, nice to meet you.

00:07:44.690 --> 00:07:47.530
It has been a while, Mr. Shoji.

00:07:50.950 --> 00:07:53.120
How do you know me?

00:07:54.530 --> 00:07:57.870
Why do you ask?
We've met so many times before.

00:07:59.250 --> 00:08:02.540
What? I've never come to meet her.

00:08:03.500 --> 00:08:04.880
Éléonore...

00:08:05.040 --> 00:08:05.960
I'm not Éléonore.

00:08:08.510 --> 00:08:10.590
My name is Shirogane.

00:08:10.760 --> 00:08:14.970
A poor puppet
who's even forgotten how to smile.

00:08:15.810 --> 00:08:20.270
You told me that over and over
every time we met.

00:08:21.100 --> 00:08:22.810
Who told you that?

00:08:22.980 --> 00:08:24.770
Shoji.

00:08:25.690 --> 00:08:27.780
Circumstances have changed.

00:08:27.940 --> 00:08:31.530
That girl must go now to Eastern Europe.

00:08:32.070 --> 00:08:36.990
-But...
-Shiroganes are destroyers of automata.

00:08:39.080 --> 00:08:41.460
-Good day.
-No...

00:08:46.920 --> 00:08:48.460
You're my daughter.

00:08:54.640 --> 00:08:57.470
We were going to live in peace in Japan.

00:09:02.980 --> 00:09:04.020
Éléonore!

00:09:09.070 --> 00:09:13.740
So somebody is posing as you
and is plotting something.

00:09:15.490 --> 00:09:18.330
The same thing happened
at Kuroga Village, too.

00:09:18.830 --> 00:09:20.160
Who could it be?

00:09:21.540 --> 00:09:23.330
You must already know.

00:09:25.290 --> 00:09:28.500
Who other than the automata
could've known our moves?

00:09:29.040 --> 00:09:35.300
And who knows how to make marionettes
and could pull off pretending to be you?

00:09:37.510 --> 00:09:39.930
No, you don't mean...

00:09:42.140 --> 00:09:43.810
Sadayoshi Saiga.

00:09:44.640 --> 00:09:47.860
Real name, the shirogane Dean Maistre.

00:09:49.190 --> 00:09:51.360
But what for?

00:09:52.070 --> 00:09:53.780
I don't know yet.

00:09:54.070 --> 00:09:57.070
But I'll look into him.

00:10:02.830 --> 00:10:06.710
Nobody knew about Dean's past.

00:10:08.080 --> 00:10:09.920
SADAYOSHI'S MANSION, TOKYO

00:10:12.590 --> 00:10:13.420
What is it?

00:10:14.670 --> 00:10:16.800
I've messed up big time.

00:10:17.760 --> 00:10:20.850
Seems like I knocked a girl up.

00:10:21.510 --> 00:10:23.140
What...?

00:10:23.770 --> 00:10:26.690
What will you do?
Are you going to marry her?

00:10:28.270 --> 00:10:30.770
Yeah right, I'm too old for that.

00:10:32.190 --> 00:10:37.200
But I might pay her to raise the kid.

00:10:38.490 --> 00:10:41.030
And maybe name him Masaru.

00:10:41.200 --> 00:10:44.700
Because "Masaru" means to win.
And I like winning.

00:10:47.670 --> 00:10:52.250
I'd never seen Sadayoshi
looking like that before.

00:10:57.800 --> 00:11:00.510
And so Masaru arrived
at the Saiga mansion.

00:11:01.260 --> 00:11:04.520
I loved him like he was my real grandson.

00:11:05.640 --> 00:11:08.520
One day, Sadayoshi called me to Karuizawa.

00:11:09.650 --> 00:11:11.060
"PUPPET 14, SADAYOSHI SAIGA"

00:11:11.230 --> 00:11:12.310
What's this?

00:11:12.610 --> 00:11:15.230
It's my notebook. Take a look.

00:11:20.200 --> 00:11:21.740
Masaru is bait.

00:11:23.870 --> 00:11:26.620
If I leave my fortune to Masaru,

00:11:26.790 --> 00:11:31.290
the family will hire the Kuroga clan
and fight over Masaru.

00:11:32.040 --> 00:11:37.720
The divided Kuroga clan will
use their puppets to kill one another.

00:11:38.510 --> 00:11:41.300
Masaru is the bait to make that happen.

00:11:41.800 --> 00:11:45.470
What the...
Is this what you took Masaru in for?

00:11:45.640 --> 00:11:47.060
Just kidding.

00:11:48.270 --> 00:11:50.980
It's a joke, lighten up.

00:11:55.190 --> 00:11:57.030
I shuddered.

00:11:57.530 --> 00:12:01.570
Because despite his words,
I knew Sadayoshi meant it.

00:12:03.030 --> 00:12:05.200
SADAYOSHI'S MANSION, TOKYO

00:12:05.370 --> 00:12:09.910
Lucille, I want to renew my plea
of 15 years ago.

00:12:10.370 --> 00:12:16.500
Please send that Éléonore girl to Japan
to help me find the soft stone.

00:12:18.710 --> 00:12:23.510
Masaru, I love you now
as much as my own daughter.

00:12:24.800 --> 00:12:28.060
I know Éléonore will be able
to protect you.

00:12:28.430 --> 00:12:33.400
I'm sure it must be safer
for Éléonore, too, than to fight automata.

00:12:36.110 --> 00:12:41.990
I didn't know then, but I was already
walking into the trap Sadayoshi had set.

00:12:48.290 --> 00:12:49.500
Yes?

00:12:50.910 --> 00:12:52.620
Help us...

00:12:53.170 --> 00:12:56.290
Who is this?
If it's a prank, I'm hanging up.

00:12:56.460 --> 00:12:57.420
Hello.

00:12:58.670 --> 00:13:00.300
Can you hear me?

00:13:00.460 --> 00:13:02.630
Sadayoshi. What's going on?

00:13:04.550 --> 00:13:08.060
There's been an outbreak of ZONAPHA
at Kuroga Village.

00:13:08.220 --> 00:13:09.890
What did you say?

00:13:10.470 --> 00:13:16.150
Come see for yourself. But don't tell
the shirogane headquarters or Guy.

00:13:31.160 --> 00:13:32.960
What took you so long?

00:13:36.830 --> 00:13:39.420
What have you done?

00:13:40.000 --> 00:13:42.920
-That's what I'd like to ask you.
-What?

00:13:43.800 --> 00:13:46.680
I can finally make you pay.

00:13:47.300 --> 00:13:48.680
For what? You...

00:13:51.180 --> 00:13:53.890
It's not your turn to speak now.

00:13:55.390 --> 00:13:58.940
I've been waiting for my turn
for over 100 years.

00:14:00.070 --> 00:14:06.160
Of course, you won't be getting a turn,
since you stole Angelina from me.

00:14:06.820 --> 00:14:09.160
Stole Angelina from you?

00:14:10.030 --> 00:14:12.540
-You don't mean...
-That's right.

00:14:12.790 --> 00:14:17.170
I'd had my eyes on her
for much longer than you ever had.

00:14:18.540 --> 00:14:21.420
But she suddenly disappeared
from Quiberon.

00:14:21.670 --> 00:14:24.260
When we finally heard from her,

00:14:24.420 --> 00:14:28.890
she was wed to some monkey
from a faraway barbaric island!

00:14:29.680 --> 00:14:31.100
What a joke, huh?

00:14:34.890 --> 00:14:37.350
Then why did you pretend to be my aide?

00:14:38.100 --> 00:14:42.400
I was going to wait for Angelina
to come to her senses.

00:14:42.570 --> 00:14:43.530
But...

00:14:44.570 --> 00:14:46.650
I'm pregnant.

00:14:46.990 --> 00:14:48.280
That's wonderful!

00:14:48.820 --> 00:14:50.740
Congratulations, Shoji.

00:14:51.370 --> 00:14:54.450
Angelina's love is really yours now.

00:14:56.040 --> 00:15:01.210
Angelina became nothing to me
ever since that day.

00:15:02.290 --> 00:15:04.920
She's just a foolish woman
who didn't choose me.

00:15:07.840 --> 00:15:10.300
So you attacked her for the soft stone?

00:15:14.010 --> 00:15:15.560
For eternal life!

00:15:16.060 --> 00:15:17.020
What?

00:15:22.610 --> 00:15:24.610
Even shiroganes age.

00:15:25.070 --> 00:15:28.400
Even if only once every 5 years,
they age too.

00:15:29.320 --> 00:15:31.530
But some things never age.

00:15:31.950 --> 00:15:32.950
Automata?

00:15:33.700 --> 00:15:38.540
That's right. I yearned to be like them.

00:15:39.790 --> 00:15:44.250
Automata can live on forever
just by changing parts.

00:15:44.420 --> 00:15:50.800
So I decided to use Aqua Vitae
to change my parts, too.

00:15:52.090 --> 00:15:54.720
These parts that people call the "body."

00:15:55.010 --> 00:15:55.970
You're crazy.

00:15:56.430 --> 00:15:59.230
No, it's very simple.

00:15:59.390 --> 00:16:03.480
I'll let somebody drink the Aqua Vitae
that I've melted myself into.

00:16:04.520 --> 00:16:09.990
Then my memories and personality
can be reborn in a new body.

00:16:10.740 --> 00:16:16.490
So you needed the soft stone
to be able to do that over and over.

00:16:17.080 --> 00:16:22.500
Right. You can make all the Aqua Vitae
you want with the soft stone.

00:16:23.580 --> 00:16:25.500
Angelina died because of that...

00:16:26.000 --> 00:16:27.840
Yeah, that was a failure.

00:16:28.010 --> 00:16:31.130
I'd cleared the village of villagers
by posing as you.

00:16:31.300 --> 00:16:35.550
But the soft stone wasn't inside
Angelina's body.

00:16:36.810 --> 00:16:40.810
So tell me before you die.

00:16:41.940 --> 00:16:44.440
Where's the soft stone now?

00:16:49.400 --> 00:16:51.900
I'll never tell you! Not you!

00:16:59.200 --> 00:17:01.540
How dare you hit me!

00:17:07.000 --> 00:17:08.550
Answer me this.

00:17:09.250 --> 00:17:13.130
Why did you pretend to be me
and feed her ideas?

00:17:16.090 --> 00:17:18.890
Have you heard of
the human downloading theory?

00:17:19.470 --> 00:17:20.430
Download?

00:17:21.560 --> 00:17:25.270
You change all the brain's information
into electrical signals.

00:17:25.440 --> 00:17:27.900
And you transfer it to another brain.

00:17:28.230 --> 00:17:31.650
-I'm asking you about...!
-Yes, Éléonore.

00:17:34.360 --> 00:17:37.660
It was when I went to Quiberon as Dean.

00:17:38.990 --> 00:17:42.910
It was another fateful meeting,
just like with Angelina.

00:17:47.080 --> 00:17:49.920
Should I protect her
to form a strong bond?

00:17:50.090 --> 00:17:53.510
No, I failed with Angelina
using those tactics.

00:17:54.630 --> 00:17:56.430
So then, I realized.

00:17:56.680 --> 00:18:01.680
That I could use the download theory
I was working on.

00:18:02.430 --> 00:18:07.150
Instead of protecting her,
I'd make her protect me.

00:18:08.400 --> 00:18:12.230
I'd put ideas into her head
to make her want to protect me.

00:18:12.480 --> 00:18:15.200
So she wouldn't stray from me again.

00:18:16.280 --> 00:18:20.240
Shirogane, protect young Masaru.

00:18:20.780 --> 00:18:22.950
Protect him with all your heart.

00:18:23.540 --> 00:18:26.540
And you won't be a puppet anymore.

00:18:27.670 --> 00:18:30.750
And I'd become that Masaru.

00:18:33.130 --> 00:18:39.510
Me, in Masaru's body, and Éléonore
will be bound together with a strong bond.

00:18:41.510 --> 00:18:45.140
That way, I'd be able to gain
two things at once.

00:18:45.310 --> 00:18:49.560
One, a new body that will lead me
to an eternal life.

00:18:49.900 --> 00:18:54.990
Two, a beautiful guardian
who will never be able to leave my side.

00:18:55.150 --> 00:18:57.450
Good idea, huh?

00:18:59.490 --> 00:19:02.740
You're disgusting.
You make me want to throw up.

00:19:03.160 --> 00:19:08.000
-But you helped me with my plot.
-What do you mean?

00:19:09.290 --> 00:19:14.750
You read my notebook and called Éléonore
to protect Masaru.

00:19:16.010 --> 00:19:18.380
Remember what you told Masaru?

00:19:18.550 --> 00:19:21.720
That Shirogane would protect him.

00:19:22.260 --> 00:19:26.020
Not knowing that I'd be downloaded
into that Masaru.

00:19:26.890 --> 00:19:29.770
You bastard! I'll never forgive you!

00:19:30.480 --> 00:19:33.020
I have no use for you anymore! Die!

00:19:36.480 --> 00:19:37.610
Running away?

00:19:48.790 --> 00:19:52.670
Hey now, I know you won't die
with just that.

00:19:57.460 --> 00:20:01.840
I used you, and now I'm going to kill you.

00:20:04.100 --> 00:20:08.600
You need lots of data and
precise equipment for downloading, right?

00:20:09.270 --> 00:20:10.600
So what?

00:20:12.850 --> 00:20:16.610
Did you think I hadn't been watching you?

00:20:17.940 --> 00:20:19.610
You know something?

00:20:20.700 --> 00:20:25.620
I bet your precious data
is burning wonderfully now.

00:20:26.080 --> 00:20:27.290
No...

00:20:27.450 --> 00:20:28.620
You lose.

00:20:29.200 --> 00:20:31.370
Sh... Shoji!

00:20:36.460 --> 00:20:39.090
He's lying. I know he's lying.

00:20:49.890 --> 00:20:52.770
I can't die yet.

00:20:53.270 --> 00:20:55.400
KARUIZAWA

00:20:57.150 --> 00:21:00.030
It'll take years
to prepare a new download!

00:21:00.610 --> 00:21:02.950
Shoji...!

00:21:07.530 --> 00:21:09.120
You'll be fine now.

00:21:09.830 --> 00:21:11.870
I've healed some people.

00:21:12.370 --> 00:21:14.000
Now go save the rest.

00:21:15.750 --> 00:21:19.750
I gave up most of my blood
to save the villagers.

00:21:20.260 --> 00:21:22.380
And fell into a deep sleep.

00:21:22.550 --> 00:21:26.140
We must protect Master Shoji.

00:21:34.140 --> 00:21:39.820
Grandpa, no...
You said you'd be back soon.

00:21:43.240 --> 00:21:45.110
Circumstances have changed.

00:21:45.280 --> 00:21:49.700
Work at the circus in Tokyo
for the time being.

00:21:50.660 --> 00:21:55.370
Wait there until Masaru comes to you
asking for help.

00:21:55.710 --> 00:21:57.170
Shoji Saiga.

00:21:59.670 --> 00:22:04.050
Éléonore will do exactly
as I told her to in the letter.

00:22:04.220 --> 00:22:08.720
And I'll prepare the download
in the meantime.

00:22:27.610 --> 00:22:31.990
Avoiding the crowds, I walk in the dark

00:22:32.160 --> 00:22:36.960
And wait with bated breath in the wings

00:22:37.120 --> 00:22:41.630
My expression is calm
while I scream inside

00:22:41.800 --> 00:22:46.590
On the verge of being torn apart

00:22:46.760 --> 00:22:51.300
I dance and beckon you to join me

00:22:51.550 --> 00:22:56.230
As a shadow swings across the stage

00:22:56.390 --> 00:22:59.230
I tell myself this is the last time

00:22:59.400 --> 00:23:05.240
But I can't seem to cut myself free

00:23:05.440 --> 00:23:09.780
Too scared to stop for a moment

00:23:09.950 --> 00:23:15.290
My impatience hides
the cries of somebody left behind

00:23:15.700 --> 00:23:23.750
Nobody notices the shadow
standing in the sudden rain

00:23:23.920 --> 00:23:31.760
Somewhere far away,
a memory of you is saying goodbye

00:23:31.930 --> 00:23:39.140
I stand here watching,
no longer able to reach you
